<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left"><b>G = Georgia, J = Jenny, I = Ivan, M = Madison</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:03.5]<b>1</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect="J:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:05]Why don’t you try hot water with honey and lemon?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="G:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:08.9]Thanks. That’s a good idea.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:13]<b>2</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect="J:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:15]You should go back to bed.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="G:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:17]Yes, I think I’ll do that.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:21]<b>3</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect="I:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:23]Have you tried honey and butter in hot milk?</p>]]></text>
<text sect="G:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:26.9]No, I haven’t tried that.</p>]]></text>
<text sect=""><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:31]<b>4</b></p>]]></text>
<text sect="M:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:33]You should have honey and vinegar in hot water.</p>]]></text>
<text sect="G:"><![CDATA[<p align="left">[00:36]Oh, I don’t fancy that!</p>]]></text>
